  m_text: "3 \xB7 Floating Score Text \u2014 Canvas space, Text payload\nCLICK THE
    STAR: a \"+N\" pops off it, floats up and fades.\nEach click plays a fresh popup
    \u2014 the number is passed as text and the payload writes it through a reused
    StringBuilder.\nClick detection needs no EventSystem: A2BDemoClickToPlay hit-tests
    the pointer against the star's rect."
